Hi Evan,

As of today, I do not see an application to withdraw the service in our sys=
tem, to be in compliance they would need to provide you with a minimum 3 mo=
nth notice on the correct form advising you of such information.

With respect to the area not being secured, was this an area that was previ=
ously secured with a locked door? If you would like an Officer contact them=
, please provide the contact information.

Thank you,
VLH/RTB

